OL,3,GNEWSAHow Teesside made its mark on
OL,4,AWorld Trade Center
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was a remarkable feat of engineering
OL,7,Fand created what were then, the two
OL,8,Ftallest buildings in the world.
OL,10,FBut few people know how skilled workers
OL,11,Fon Teesside played their part in
OL,12,Fbuilding Manhattan's World Trade Center
OL,13,F- including the Twin Towers.
OL,15,FAmong them was Ray Ward, from
OL,16,FMarske-by-the-Sea, who worked as a
OL,17,Fdraughtsman at American firm Nassau,
OL,18,Fwhich he said set up an office in
OL,19,FThornaby to recruit skilled workers in
OL,20,Fthe 1960s.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
