OL,3,GNEWSAHow Teesside made its mark on
OL,4,AWorld Trade Center
OL,5,
OL,6,FOnce finished, he stood on top of the
OL,7,Ftowers, and thought, "this will be
OL,8,Falright, it was done in Thornaby," but
OL,9,Fhad no idea what he helped build would
OL,10,Fbecome rubble 30 years on.
